<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bowater downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bowater downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter lowered its recommendation on Bowater Inc to swap from neutral, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- A second source at the firm confirmed the downgrade and also said the 1996 earnings estimate has been cut to $3.65 from $3.90 and the 1997 view has been cut to $2.15 from $3.00 per share.</p>
<p>-- The stock was cut due to its valuation and the earnings view was trimmed because of a &quot;weaker outlook for newsprint and coated paper pricing,&quot; the second source said.</p>
<p>-- The shares were off 1/8 to 35-7/8 in midmorning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
